[node name="KingBooArena" type="Node3D"]
metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 153: KING BOO'S ARENA -- the casino's great roulette table (the three discs at one height, the game's layout) with King Boo over its centre. Drop it into the level where the table should be: the discs' walking faces are 1.1 to 1.9 m BELOW this node (the centre disc lowest), the outer ring 34 m across, so put the node 2 m over the room's floor or let the table stand in a pit. King Boo finds the discs by himself (sms_roulette). The centre disc's pond (the game's water the player refills from) is solid floor here: add one of your sms_water Area3D volumes over it (7 m radius, the face at -1.9 m) if you want it to hold water."

